   "text": "the ball does not slow down because it is tired. It slows down because the GRADIENT shrinks near the minimum. Same lr, smaller steps — that is the whole algorithm.",
   "originalText": "the ball does not slow down because it is tired. It slows down because the GRADIENT shrinks near the minimum. Same lr, smaller steps — that is the whole algorithm.",
